orce  and qi is  the  modal  coordinate  of the i th mode."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Whereas the  system  described  by  (2)  is  coupled,  the system  described  by  (4)  is  uncoupled  since  all  the matrices have been diagonalized.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":179.0821985213273,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":309.05012,"r":541.0882400000002,"t":211.8219746484375},"charspan":[0,150],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/41","text":"Whereas the  system  described  by  (2)  is  coupled,  the system  described  by  (4)  is  uncoupled  since  all  the matrices have been diagonalized."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"The solutions qi to the decoupled equations are given by:","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":154.93483852132726,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":309.05271999999997,"r":541.0012000000003,"t":175.5532946484375},"charspan":[0,57],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/42","text":"The solutions qi to the decoupled equations are given by:"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"formula","orig":"1,2) ( ) ( 2      i Pk Q jc m k Q q i i i i i i i   (5)","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":118.58783344570043,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":327.6230906,"r":541.14928,"t":142.7136922484375},"charspan":[0,62],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/43","text":""},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Pki is the characteristic polynomial of mode i and j is the complex constant.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":84.97931852132729,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":309.0308,"r":541.13864,"t":105.71729464843747},"charspan":[0,77],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/44","text":"Pki is the characteristic polynomial of mode i and j is the complex constant."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"furniture","label":"page_footer","orig":"3","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":14.383932243092318,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":2